   "title": "Find a home you will love",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-featured\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-featured\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Featured homes</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">New on the market this month</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-box listing-tile\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-box listing-tile\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:modern-home}}\" alt=\"A modern white house\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{post:modern-four-bed-hillcrest}}\">Modern four-bedroom home, Hillcrest</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"listing-price\"} --><p class=\"listing-price\">$685,000</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-box listing-tile\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-box listing-tile\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:cottage}}\" alt=\"A stone cottage\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{post:stone-cottage-wildflower-garden}}\">Stone cottage with a wildflower garden</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"listing-price\"} --><p class=\"listing-price\">$415,000</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-box listing-tile\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-box listing-tile\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:townhouses}}\" alt=\"Colourful townhouses\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"{{post:colourful-townhouse-near-market}}\">Colourful townhouse near the market</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"listing-price\"} --><p class=\"listing-price\">$529,000</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:listings}}\">View all listings</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"backgroundColor\":\"forest\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-forest-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Why Keystone</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Local agents, honest numbers</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"stats\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide stats\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"stat-num\"} --><p class=\"stat-num\">1,240</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>homes sold in the valley since 2009</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"stat-num\"} --><p class=\"stat-num\">19 days</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>average time from listing to offer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"stat-num\"} --><p class=\"stat-num\">98.6%</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>of asking price achieved on average</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"stat-num\"} --><p class=\"stat-num\">4.9 / 5</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>from more than 600 client reviews</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"backgroundColor\":\"stone\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-stone-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Neighbourhoods</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Find your corner of the valley</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"area-tiles\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide area-tiles\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"area-tile\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group area-tile\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:townhouses}}\" alt=\"Old Town townhouses\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{tag:old-town}}\">Old Town</a>Cobbles, cafés and the Saturday market</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"area-tile\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group area-tile\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:apartments}}\" alt=\"Riverside apartments\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{tag:riverside}}\">Riverside</a>Apartments by the river and tram</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"area-tile\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group area-tile\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:neighbourhood}}\" alt=\"Hillcrest streets from above\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{tag:hillcrest}}\">Hillcrest</a>Family homes and good schools</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"area-tile\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group area-tile\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:lake-cabin}}\" alt=\"A cabin on the lake\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{tag:lakeside}}\">Lakeside</a>Cabins, water and quiet evenings</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-box\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-box\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"num\"} --><p class=\"num\">01</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Buying</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Early access to new listings, honest advice on price and a guide through every step to the keys.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-box\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-box\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"num\"} --><p class=\"num\">02</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Selling</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A free valuation, professional photographs and viewings run by the agent who knows your home.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-box\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-box\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"num\"} --><p class=\"num\">03</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Renting</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Carefully checked tenants, clear agreements and repairs handled quickly for landlords.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} --><div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div><!-- /wp:spacer --><!-- wp:media-text {\"align\":\"wide\",\"mediaPosition\":\"right\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"{{media:agents}}\" alt=\"Three agents standing together\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Our team</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Twelve agents who live where they sell</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every Keystone agent lives in the valley. We know which streets flood, which schools have waiting lists and where the morning sun falls in the garden.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>They sold our house in eleven days and found us the cottage we now call home.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>A family who moved to the Old Town</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:about}}\">Meet the agents</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div><!-- /wp:media-text --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"{{media:hero}}\",\"dimRatio\":60,\"overlayColor\":\"charcoal\",\"align\":\"full\",\"minHeight\":420} --><div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"min-height:420px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-charcoal-background-color has-background-dim-60 has-background-dim\"></span><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"\" src=\"{{media:hero}}\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">What is your home worth?</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Book a free, no-obligation valuation with a local agent. It takes about forty minutes.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-accent\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-accent\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Book a valuation</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div><!-- /wp:cover -->",
   "featured_media": "hero",
