  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About Keystone",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Keystone Estates was founded in 2009 by two agents who wanted to run the kind of agency they would trust with their own homes: local, plain-spoken and properly organised.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"align\":\"wide\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"{{media:agents}}\" alt=\"Three stylised agents\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How we work</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"feature-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list feature-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>One agent looks after you from valuation to keys.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>No long contracts: four weeks' notice, always.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We publish our fees on this page.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Every viewing is accompanied.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div></div><!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our fees</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table --><figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Fee</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Selling</td><td>1.2% of the sale price</td></tr><tr><td>Letting, tenant find</td><td>One month's rent</td></tr><tr><td>Full management</td><td>10% of monthly rent</td></tr><tr><td>Valuation</td><td>Free</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote --><figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>A good agent should make moving feel smaller, not bigger.</p></blockquote></figure><!-- /wp:pullquote -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "selling",
   "title": "Selling with us",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Selling a home is a big step. This guide explains what happens, week by week, when you sell with Keystone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Valuation.</strong> An agent visits, looks at recent sales and recommends a price.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Preparation.</strong> We suggest small improvements and book photographs.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Launch.</strong> Your home goes live online and to our buyer list on the same day.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Viewings and offers.</strong> We accompany every viewing and report back the same evening.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Sale agreed.</strong> We chase solicitors and surveyors until the keys change hands.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:front-door}}\" alt=\"A green front door\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Book a valuation</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Contact",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Call, write or drop in. We answer the phone six days a week.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Office</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>48 Orchard Row<br>Millbrook, MB2 7KE</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Phone</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"tel:+15550167700\">+1 (555) 016-7700</a><br>Mon–Sat 9:00–18:00</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Email</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"mailto:homes@keystone.example\">homes@keystone.example</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:neighbourhood}}\" alt=\"An aerial view of the neighbourhood\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">We cover Millbrook, the Old Town, Riverside, Hillcrest and the lake villages.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image -->"
  }
 ],
 "posts": [
  {
   "slug": "modern-four-bed-hillcrest",
   "title": "Modern four-bedroom home with pool, Hillcrest",
   "date": "2026-10-20T09:00:00",
   "categories": [
    "for-sale"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "hillcrest"
   ],
   "featured_media": "modern-home",
   "sticky": true,
   "excerpt": "$685,000 · 4 bedrooms · 3 bathrooms · 2,450 sq ft",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"listing-price\"} --><p class=\"listing-price\">$685,000 <small>Freehold</small></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"property-facts\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list property-facts\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Bedrooms</strong>4</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Bathrooms</strong>3</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Living area</strong>2,450 sq ft</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Lot</strong>0.3 acres</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Built</strong>2019</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Parking</strong>Double garage</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Set on a quiet crescent at the top of Hillcrest, this architect-designed home is all clean lines, timber and glass. The ground floor opens onto a terrace and a heated pool with views across the valley.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Upstairs, a cantilevered wing holds three bedrooms and a principal suite with a dressing room and a bathroom lit by a long skylight.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Features</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"feature-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list feature-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Open-plan kitchen and living space</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Heated outdoor pool</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Underfloor heating throughout</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Solar panels and battery</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Home office with separate entrance</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Landscaped, low-maintenance garden</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:living-room}}\" alt=\"The living room with a sage sofa\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Location</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Hillcrest is a ten-minute drive from the town centre and a short walk from the primary school and the ridge trail.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"agent-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group agent-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Want to see it?</strong> Viewings are available six days a week, including early evenings.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Book a viewing</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": "Dana F.",
     "email": "dana@example.com",
     "content": "Is the home office soundproofed? We both work from home.",
     "date": "2026-10-21T13:00:00"
