  {
   "slug": "autumn-market-report",
   "title": "Autumn market report: what buyers are paying in the valley",
   "date": "2026-10-15T08:00:00",
   "categories": [
    "market-news"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "old-town",
    "hillcrest"
   ],
   "featured_media": "neighbourhood",
   "excerpt": "Prices held steady through the summer, but homes with gardens are selling fastest. Here is our quarterly view.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The valley market had a steady summer. Prices are broadly flat on last year, but the speed of sales tells a more interesting story: homes with outdoor space are moving twice as fast as those without.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table --><figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Average price</th><th>Change on last year</th><th>Average days to sell</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Old Town</td><td>$468,000</td><td>+2%</td><td>21</td></tr><tr><td>Riverside</td><td>$402,000</td><td>0%</td><td>34</td></tr><tr><td>Hillcrest</td><td>$612,000</td><td>+4%</td><td>17</td></tr><tr><td>Lakeside</td><td>$355,000</td><td>−1%</td><td>46</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What it means for sellers</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Price realistically from the start; overpriced homes sit.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Spend on the garden before the kitchen: buyers are paying for outdoor space.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Good photographs still matter more than anything else online.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buyers are cautious, not absent. Well-presented homes at the right price are still selling within three weeks.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Keystone sales team</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ask us for a free valuation and a copy of the full report for your street.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "format": "standard"
  },
  {
   "slug": "preparing-your-home-for-viewings",
   "title": "Preparing your home for viewings: a checklist",
   "date": "2026-08-14T09:00:00",
   "categories": [
    "market-news"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "riverside"
   ],
   "featured_media": "living-room",
   "excerpt": "Small, inexpensive changes that help buyers picture themselves living in your home.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buyers decide within minutes whether a home feels right. The good news is that the changes that matter most cost very little.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A week before</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Fix dripping taps and sticky doors</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Clear the hallway and stairs</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Store half of what is on shelves</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">On the day</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Open curtains and switch lamps on</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Fresh towels and a made bed</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Pets and their bowls out of sight</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:front-door}}\" alt=\"A green front door between two potted trees\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">First impressions start at the front door.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our agents walk through every home before the first viewing and leave a short list of suggestions. It is part of the service.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "format": "standard"
  }
